From d3ca68f9d06e5daa8e37270731eda5b529111f3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VideoPlayerGold <jestar001@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 09:01:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vf_cudapass: identity CUDA filter (device-to-device copy
 spike)

Adds a native user filter that takes cuda[nv12|p010] frames from nvdec,
copies each plane D2D into a filter-owned CUDA allocation under a
filter-owned AVHWFramesContext, and emits the copy as a cuda frame.
No pixel changes. Proves registration, decoder-context borrowing,
hwdec_cuda-mappable output frames and vf-command hot parameters.
Driver symbols via ffnvcodec dynlink (no CUDA toolkit at build time).
Built only when the cuda-hwaccel feature is enabled.
